sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as Client App
    participant S as Auth Server
    participant DB as Database



    rect rgb(244, 242, 245)
    Note over C,S: Token Consumption - Protected Resource Access
    U->>C: Request protected data
    C->>S: GET /data<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    Note over S: Decode JWT header + payload (base64)<br/>Verify HMAC-SHA256 signature with SECRET<br/>Check exp, iss, aud claims
    S->>S: 
    alt Token valid
        S->>DB: SELECT perso_data WHERE user_id = sub(JWT)
        DB-->>S: { message }
        S-->>C: 200 { data: message }
        C-->>U: Display protected data
    else Token invalid or expired
        S-->>C: 401 { reason: invalid or expired token }
        C-->>U: Error - re-authentication required
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
    Note over C,S: Token Expiry and Re-authentication
    Note over C: JWT has no refresh mechanism in ZKP flow<br/>Token expires after TTL
    C->>C: 
    C->>S: GET /data<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT (expired)
    S-->>C: 401 { reason: token expired }
    Note over C: Client must restart full ZKP login<br/>(commit -> verify) to obtain a new token
    C->>C: 
    C-->>U: Session ended - login again
    end
